e-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/4/44/DFF_Summonstone.png/revision/latest?cb=20100712153022\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Ramuh (AUTO)\"><img alt=\"Ramuh (AUTO)\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"38\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Summonstone.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Summonstone.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/4/44/DFF_Summonstone.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20100712153022\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden;float:left;margin:0 1px\"><div style=\"position:relative;left:-0px;margin-right:-18px;top:-0px;margin-bottom:-5px;;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/4/43/Dissicon_ff9_zid1.png/revision/latest?cb=20110126043215\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Dissicon ff9 zid1\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"53\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dissicon ff9 zid1.png\" data-image-key=\"Dissicon_ff9_zid1.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/4/43/Dissicon_ff9_zid1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/53?cb=20110126043215\" /></a></span></div></div>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Oak Staff\"><img alt=\"Oak Staff\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Imitation Despot\"><img alt=\"Imitation Despot\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>This gateway is one of the precious few times a Round Chain has any use, and I happened to get one from the orbs on my way here. You can use a Multichain at C4 if you want, you'll make 16 KP for the chain and can go but another Multichain when you're done, but I was cheap and decided the Round Chain would lead to larger net winnings, being that it was free and didn't need replacing. I used it at C4 to chain the three, then manually chained the last two. Zidane is our Assist, his ground attack is Rumble Rush and is a combo that launches the opponent into the air, his aerial attack is Vortex which much like Jecht's ground assist slams the opponent up and probably out of reach. Heavenly Strike slams the opponent down so stick to the ground Assist for Zidane. You'll also find a new arena here, Dream's End, which FFX fan will recognize easily I should hope. It's a big wide-open arena with a banish trap pit on most of it, you can fight on the central large platform or the outlying grandstands, and railings along the outside let you quickmove between the two. \n</p><p>Enemy line-up, the Ephemeral Phantom, Ephemeral Summoner and Fleeting Flash are familiar. The Imitation Despot is a problem though, he's got Thunder Crest and Dyanmite, remember them from the Report? Except his HP attack this time is the ground Flare, which sends out a large fireball that slowly tracks us around the stage for a long long time, making it a constant danger, and if you get caught in one of his Bravery attacks that stuns you, there's a good chance Flare will come around and explode in your face as you writhe trapped. Don't let this happen. Other characters can deflect it to track and hurt him like Laguna's Ragnarok Blade or Lightning's Crushing Blow. Yuna has no such attacks to do this yet, sadly. There's another new enemy, the False Hero. He has Dayflash on the ground, a quick three-hit combo, and Rising Buckler in the air which is an upwards-swooping attack that hurts a lot, listen for his cry to block it if you're above him. His HP attack is Shield of Light, he blocks and fires a blast of light at short-range, but our HP attacks will crush it and Heavenly Strike won't stagger us for getting blocked.\n</p><p>The only trick here is the enemies have summons. The Flash has Odin, summoned when you Break her, and it might Break you back. The Despot has Bahamut for periodic boosts of 75 Bravery, and the Phantom has Demon Wall to protect his Bravery from damage when he gets low on it, fortunately you'll have no trouble building up Bravery to kill him without needing to Break him. With the first round of enemies dead, the chest has an Oak Staff, useless for Yuna with the Capella on her belt, and the Ramuh summonstone. Ramuh summons himself automatically when we get Broken (and if you're getting Broken at this stage of the game, you're doing it wrong), and seals the opponent's summonstone (not that enemies at this stage of the game really use them too often, and again, if the ones that do are Breaking you, you're doing it wrong). So yeah he's pretty useless. All automatic summons have manual versions, and the difference is usually the automatic ones have more charges and recharge faster while the manual ones let you decide when to use them, and which of the two is stronger depends on the exact summon, but Ramuh is one of the ones that you never want the automatic version for.\n</p><p>Zidane runs off when we get to the exit, I guess he realized Yuna has a boyfriend so hitting on her is wrong, and we're alone again on the world map.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Family_Reunion\">Family Reunion</span><a title=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Family Reunion\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Walkthrough:Dissidia_012_Final_Fantasy/Drake/Part_4?action=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section&#39;s source code: Family Reunion\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Ephemeral Phantom\"><img alt=\"Ephemeral Phantom\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a h